
"Global approach" means forming the Hilbert space with prior knowledge for DP problem. 
"Local approach" will use much simpler, easy to come up with, basis that forms much simpler Hilbert space. 
Essentially, "Local approah" can forecast but shows extrapolation capability much limited than "Global approach".

Still, "Local approach" provides initiative to construct a Surrogate model especially if the problem has
plenty of data and if the main focus is multi-input multi-output interpolation.
